/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.profraw
/tmp

# Rendered artefacts from the conformance and comparison harnesses: PNGs, diffs and
# heatmaps are regenerated on demand from committed scenes, so they are output rather
# than source. A comparison that matters is pinned by a *scene* plus a stated
# expectation, never by a stray image on a developer's disk.
/target/conformance
/artefacts

# Persisted pipeline caches (RENDER_LIBRARY.md §7). Driver-specific binary blobs; a
# stale one must never be a build input.
/pipeline-cache

# Claude Code local settings (per-user, not shared).
.claude/settings.local.json
# Agent worktrees: separate checkouts of this repository, never content of it.
.claude/worktrees/

# Per-user cargo configuration. This tree is shared through a group, and the users who
# build it have different `target-dir` settings for that reason; a committed absolute
# path would be wrong for everyone but its author. The one in this checkout explains
# itself.
/.cargo/config.toml
